:"El 29 de diciembre de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en Channelview registró 12.97 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 7:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.06 ppb. El viento venía de 16 grados a 6.1 mph. Hay 12 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. No se encontró un informe correspondiente en una búsqueda completa de los registros de eventos de emisiones de ese día en el condado de Harris. Eso no indica quién o qué causó la lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación en este corredor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' would not mean 'illegal': Texas requires a report only above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade state monitors are used; many neighborhoods have none."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0069_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87894,"sha256":"2375f9582494c8511986eacd0c1eb65559bd314ab3162542923d26f3713455d9","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:38+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0307_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"b